msgid "&kmail; tries to save your mail to <filename class=\"directory\">$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/apps/kmail/autosave</filename> in case of a crash. The next time you start &kmail; the mail composer should appear with your mail again; If it does not, try to open the files in <filename class=\"directory\">$(kde4-config --localprefix)/share/apps/kmail/autosave</filename> with an editor. If there are no files in this folder then the crash was so bad that &kmail; could not save your mail."
