#: faq.docbook:508
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "See the <link linkend=\"popfilters\">Download filters</link> chapter. If you want to leave all messages on the server: open up the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> window. Click on the <guilabel>Network</guilabel> page. Select your account from the account list and click the <guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button. This dialog contains the <guilabel>Leave fetched messages on the server</guilabel> setting which you must enable."
